/*
SEGMENTED ENEMY QUICK REFERENCE
===============================

When adding new segmented enemies, remember to:
1. Add `isSegmented: true` to enemy definition
2. Import the new enemy class here
3. Add case in createEnemyFromDefinition switch statement
4. See Character.ts for detailed creation guide

Current segmented enemies:
- Serpents: SerpentColossus, FireSerpent, GlassSerpent, GlyphSerpent
- Worms: StarWorm, CosmosEel
- Wyrms: FrostWyrm, AuroraWyrm  
- Leviathans: LeviathanEye, AbyssLeviathan, MoonLeviathan, CelestialKraken, GlassLeviathan, InkstormLeviathan
- Dragons: SolarDragon, SupernovaDragon, ResonantDragon, CodexDragon
- Plants: LivingRoot, CreepingVines
- Solar: SolarFlareProbe
*/

